    'When traveling across remote highland passes (Ella, Nuwara Eliya, Hatton) or coastal national park routes (Yala, Wilpattu, Kumana, Bundala), fuel stations can be 20–35 km apart. Major expressways (E01 Southern Expressway, E03 Airport Highway, E02 Outer Circular) have dedicated 24-hour service plazas like Welipenna. Keep tire pressure checked at 32 psi and maintain at least half a tank when climbing hills.': 'When traveling across remote highland passes (Ella, Nuwara Eliya, Hatton) or coastal national park routes (Yala, Wilpattu, Kumana, Bundala), fuel stations can be 20–35 km apart. Major expressways (E01 Southern Expressway, E03 Airport Highway, E02 Outer Circular) have dedicated 24-hour service plazas like Welipenna. Keep tire pressure checked at 32 psi and maintain at least half a tank when climbing hills.',
